1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,750
(Sheldon:)It's simple biology. There's
nothing I can do about it.

2
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,090
(Sheldon:)Are you sure?

3
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,590
(Sheldon:)What are you suggesting?

4
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:16,230
(Penny:)I'm suggesting there
might be something

5
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:19,670
(Penny:)you could do about...
Amy's urges?

6
00:00:23,270 --> 00:00:26,410
(Sheldon:)It's illegal to spay
a human being.

7
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:31,210
(Penny:)Yeah. That's not
what I had in mind.

8
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:32,680
(Bernadette:)Oh.

9
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:35,280
(Howard:)Oh!

10
00:00:35,280 --> 00:00:37,950
You mean...
something I could do.

11
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:39,020
(Sheldon:)Exactly.

12
00:00:39,020 --> 00:00:43,860
(Sheldon:)Well, I was hoping
to avoid this.

13
00:00:43,860 --> 00:00:46,860
(Sheldon:)But I might as well
get it over with.

14
00:00:46,860 --> 00:00:49,060
(Sheldon:)Thank you, Penny.

15
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:51,300
(Sheldon:)I'll let you
know what happens.

16
00:00:54,250 --> 00:00:57,870
(Penny:)Oh, Amy, you lucky girl.

17
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:02,480
(Sheldon:)Yes. This is Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

